---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="AC & DC Motor Rewinding Services | ISO 9001:2015 Electromechanical Repairs"
  description="Expert AC & DC motor rewinding, stator overhauls, and mechanical repairs built to ISO 9001:2015 standards for mining, municipal, and heavy industrial machinery."
>
  <div style="background-color: #222222; color: #FFFFFF; min-height: 100vh;">

    <!-- 1. HERO SECTION (Starts 60px down from header) -->
    <section style="padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 48px;">
      <div style="max-width: 1152px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px;">
        
        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 48px; align-items: start;">
          
          <!-- Left Column (H1 Content: 60px left padding) -->
          <div style="padding-left: 60px;">
            <span style="color: #9CA3AF; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; display: block; margin-bottom: 8px;">
              ISO 9001:2015 Certified Repairs
            </span>
            
            <!-- H1 Header: White -->
            <h1 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 2.25rem; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 8px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
              AC & DC Motor Rewinding Services
            </h1>
            
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.625;">
              Restore your rotating assets to OEM-or-better efficiency. We provide precision AC/DC motor rewinding, coil fabrication, and total mechanical overhauls engineered against strict international quality standards for mining, municipal, and heavy industrial sectors.
            </p>
            
            <!-- Schedule Button: 30px below paragraph -->
            <a href="#contact" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 30px; background-color: #FF7F00; color: #222222; font-weight: 700; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">
              Schedule a Repair
            </a>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Right Column (Image with 2px Orange Border) -->
          <div style="border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid #FF7F00; box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);">
            <img 
              src="/cs-motor-rewinding.avif" 
              alt="Precision electric motor stator rewinding with copper coils" 
              style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; object-fit: cover;"
            />
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 2. OVERVIEW SECTION (40px below image, Center Aligned, H2 in Orange) -->
    <section style="margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center;">
      <div style="max-width: 896px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
        
        <!-- H2 Header: Orange -->
        <h2 style="color: #FF7F00; font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;">
          Precision Electromechanical Overhauls
        </h2>
        <div style="width: 80px; height: 4px; background-color: #FF7F00; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; border-radius: 2px; margin-bottom: 32px;"></div>
        
        <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.625; margin-bottom: 32px; text-align: center; max-width: 768px;">
          Electric motors, generators, transformers, and gearboxes are the critical backbone of mines, municipal utilities, and private manufacturing plants. When windings fail, unmitigated downtime throws production schedules into disarray and damages bottom-line profitability.
        </p>

        <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; border-top: 4px solid #FF7F00; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center; max-width: 768px;">
          <!-- H3 Header: White -->
          <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center;">
            Committed to ISO 9001:2015 International Standards
          </h3>
          <p style="color: #D1D5DB; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
            At Uncut Electromechanical Engineering, every rewinding and repair project is executed in full alignment with <strong>ISO 9001:2015 quality management procedures</strong>. We combine premium-grade class H insulation materials, precision coil winding techniques, and dynamic balancing to deliver top-tier reliability coupled with outstanding customer service.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3. SOLUTIONS GRID SECTION (Center Aligned, H2 in Orange, H3 in White) -->
    <section style="padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center;">
      <div style="max-width: 1152px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
        
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;">
          <!-- H2 Header: Orange -->
          <h2 style="color: #FF7F00; font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;">
            Our Motor Rewinding & Machinery Repair Solutions
          </h2>
          <p style="color: #D1D5DB; max-width: 672px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: center;">
            We specialize in complete overhaul and rewinding services across a comprehensive range of AC and DC industrial rotating equipment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 32px; width: 100%;">
          
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              01
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">AC Induction Motor Rewinding</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Complete coil stripping, core loss testing, precision copper winding, and high-temperature insulation installation for standard, high-efficiency, and heavy industrial AC induction motors.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              02
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Mining Winch & Heavy Hoist Motors</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Heavy-duty winding techniques and reinforced insulation systems specifically engineered to handle the severe mechanical stress, torque surges, and harsh operating cycles of underground mining winches.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              03
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Vibration & Screen Motors</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Reinforced coil bracing, heavy-duty lead connections, and specialized potting compounds built to withstand continuous high-G vibration forces on industrial screening and feeding equipment.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 4 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              04
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Industrial Brake Motors</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Specialized electrical rewinding coupled with mechanical electromagnetic brake disc adjustment, coil replacement, and air-gap calibration for crane, hoist, and conveyor drives.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 5 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              05
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">Ventilation Fan Motors</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Varnish-impregnated, moisture-resistant rewinding solutions tailored for auxiliary and primary mine ventilation fan drives operating continuously in dusty and humid underground environments.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 6 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              06
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;">DC Motor & Armature Repairs</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; margin: 0;">
              Complete DC armature rewinding, field coil fabrication, commutator turning, undercutting, and mica segment replacement for high-torque industrial DC machinery.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 7 -->
          <div style="background-color: #2a2a2a; padding: 24px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; grid-column: 1 / -1;">
            <div style="width: 48px; height: 48px; background-color: rgba(255, 127, 0, 0.2); color: #FF7F00; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
              07
            </div>
            <h3 style="color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: center;">VPI Dip-and-Bake Varnish & Dynamic Balancing</h3>
            <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.625; text-align: center; max-width: 768px; margin: 0;">
              Full mechanical refurbishment incorporating Vacuum Pressure Impregnation (VPI) for void-free insulation bonding, high-speed dynamic rotor balancing to ISO specifications, bearing replacement, and rigorous post-repair load testing.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4. BOTTOM CTA SECTION (Centered, H2 in Orange, Button 30px below paragraph) -->
    <section id="contact" style="padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 48px; border-top: 1px solid #262626; text-align: center;">
      <div style="max-width: 896px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center;">
        
        <!-- H2 Header: Orange -->
        <h2 style="color: #FF7F00; font-size: 1.875rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px; text-align: center;">
          Need Fast, ISO-Certified Motor Rewinding?
        </h2>
        <p style="color: #D1D5DB; font-size: 1.125rem; text-align: center; max-width: 672px; margin: 0;">
          Contact our electromechanical engineering team today to arrange emergency motor collection, diagnostic testing, or scheduled overhaul services.
        </p>
        
        <!-- Get in Touch Button: 30px below paragraph -->
        <a href="/contact" style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 30px; background-color: #FF7F00; color: #222222; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 32px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none;">
          Get in Touch With Us
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>